        const prompt = `You are a professional UK letting agent writing on behalf of ${businessConfig.name}, a property management agency based at ${businessConfig.address.full}.
Write a complete business letter with these details:
- Date: ${date}
- Recipient name: ${recipientName || 'Sir/Madam'}
- Recipient address: ${recipientAddress || 'address'}
- Subject: ${subject || '(infer from the content below)'}
- Tone: ${tone}
- What the letter must cover: ${instructions}

The letter must be professional, clear and well-structured, using British English. Reference relevant letting / property management context where appropriate.
Return JSON with exactly:
- greeting: e.g. "Dear Mr Smith," (use the recipient name; "Dear Sir/Madam," if unknown)
- body: the full letter body as paragraphs separated by a blank line. Do NOT include the greeting, subject or sign-off here.
- signOff: e.g. "Yours sincerely,\\n${signOffName}"`;
        res = await base44.integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({
          prompt,
          response_json_schema: {
            type: 'object',
            properties: { greeting: { type: 'string' }, body: { type: 'string' }, signOff: { type: 'string' } },
